  "summary_text": "[Available MCP Ecosystem Services]\n\n## audio\n  Torchaudio-based audio processing (FastAPI + MCP, 8 tools)\n  MCP servers: audio-mcp (8 tools)\n  Agents: audio_processor: Processes, resamples, slices, and extracts features from audio files, asr_manager: Manages ASR models and performs greedy transcription\n\n## discovery\n  Discovery intelligence platform (FastAPI + stdio MCP, 11 tools)\n  MCP servers: discovery-mcp (30 tools)\n  Agents: discovery_agent: Discovers files, endpoints, and law frameworks; runs pipelines, intelligence_analyst: Runs intelligence analysis including case graphs and gap reports\n\n## garge\n  Main AI tools & services hub (FastAPI + 5 MCP servers, 107 tools)\n  MCP servers: garage-core (40 tools), garage-files (10 tools), garage-ingestion (12 tools), garage-prompt (7 tools), garage-qdrant (18 tools)\n  Agents: garage_assistant: Orchestrates AI assistants, knowledge management, and LLM interactions, qdrant_manager: Manages Qdrant vector collections, ingestion, and semantic search, file_manager: Reads, writes, uploads, and manages files and transcripts, prompt_engineer: Generates, optimizes, and evaluates LLM prompts\n\n## juris-search\n  Legal document search & analysis engine (FastAPI + MCP, 44 tools)\n  MCP servers: juris-mcp (33 tools)\n  Agents: legal_searcher: Searches legal documents and jurisprudence across Brazilian courts, legal_indexer: Manages document indexing and corpus rebuilds, legal_analyst: Analyzes legal documents and citations\n\n## ocr\n  OCR & PDF processing service (FastAPI + 2 MCP servers, 10 tools)\n  MCP servers: ocr-core (5 tools), pdf-server (7 tools)\n  Agents: ocr_reader: Extracts text from images and scanned PDFs, pdf_processor: Processes PDF files for text extraction and analysis\n\n## transcription\n  Audio transcription & diarization service (FastAPI + 3 MCP servers, 61 tools)\n  MCP servers: transcription-core (5 tools), diarization (3 tools), translate (3 tools)\n  Agents: transcriber: Transcribes audio to text with speaker diarization, diarizer: Identifies speakers in audio transcriptions, translator: Translates and analyzes transcribed content\n\n## violation-refiner\n  Legal violation analysis & refinement pipeline (MCP only, 15 tools)\n  MCP servers: violation-mcp (39 tools)\n  Agents: violation_checker: Analyses transcripts and builds structured violation reports, authority_verifier: Verifies legal authorities and statute citations, qdrant_indexer: Indexes and searches violation data in Qdrant\n"
}